{"format":1,"id":"klaenge_hoeren","kurz":"kh","sprache":"ar","richtung":"rtl","titel":"الإصغاء إلى الأصوات","untertitel":"الإصغاء إلى الأصوات من حولك، وهي تأتي وتذهب، من غير الحكم عليها.","haltung":["sitzen","liegen"],"augen":"zu_oder_offen","ende":"glocke","schlaf_modus":false,"laengen":{"kurz":{"ziel_s":180},"normal":{"ziel_s":480},"lang":{"ziel_s":900}},"kb":643,"abschnitte":[{"id":"ankommen","segmente":[{"id":"s001","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/1.b5102e9b.mp3","ms":2372,"text":"اجلسْ براحة، أو استلقِ.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5.3}},{"id":"s002","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/2.0d210fae.mp3","ms":5503,"text":"أغمِضْ عينيك إن شئت. ويمكنك أن تتوقّف في أي وقت.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5.3}},{"id":"s003","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/3.2a7cfe3d.mp3","ms":7473,"text":"في هذا التمرين، أنت تُصغي فقط. لا يوجد هنا صوابٌ أو خطأ في الإصغاء.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5.3}},{"id":"s004","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/4.bb729862.mp3","ms":2579,"text":"تنفّسْ بهدوء بضع مرّات.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":6.9}}]},{"id":"nah","segmente":[{"id":"s005","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/5.ea829156.mp3","ms":6610,"text":"أصغِ أولًا إلى الأصوات القريبة جدًّا منك. في الغرفة، وفي جسمك.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":10}},{"id":"s006","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/6.d4e8fb3f.mp3","ms":6433,"text":"ربما صوت تنفّسك. أو حفيف ملابسك. أو تكتكة ساعة.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st01","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":19.8,"normal":59.3,"lang":62}}]},{"id":"fern","segmente":[{"id":"s007","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/7.8011e1cf.mp3","ms":6484,"text":"دَعْ سمعك الآن يتّسع. إلى الأصوات في الخارج، الأبعدِ فالأبعد.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":10}},{"id":"s008","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/8.41d5bcd3.mp3","ms":7579,"text":"سيّارات، ريح، أصوات الناس، عصافير. أيًّا كان ما يُسمَع الآن.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st02","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":19.8,"normal":59.3,"lang":62}}]},{"id":"eigenschaften","segmente":[{"id":"s009","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/9.3b877efc.mp3","ms":5974,"text":"لا حاجة إلى تسمية الأصوات. أصغِ فقط إلى طبيعة صوتها.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":10}},{"id":"s010","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/10.80922cf7.mp3","ms":5948,"text":"عالٍ أو خافت. حادٌّ أو عميق. قصيرٌ أو طويل.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13.7}},{"id":"s011","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/11.95b201c7.mp3","ms":4226,"text":"كيف يبدأ الصوت، ويبقى لحظة، ثم يتلاشى.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st03","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":59.3,"lang":62}}]},{"id":"stille_dazwischen","segmente":[{"id":"s012","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/12.bfdb3c84.mp3","ms":3264,"text":"أصغِ الآن أيضًا إلى الصمت بين الأصوات.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st04","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":19.8,"normal":59.3,"lang":62}},{"id":"s013","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/13.f2bd02ba.mp3","ms":4828,"text":"الصمت موجودٌ دائمًا، حتى حين يكون المكان صاخبًا.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st05","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":65.5}}]},{"id":"gedanken","segmente":[{"id":"s014","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/14.49db2a83.mp3","ms":4111,"text":"إذا جاءت فكرة، فتعامَلْ معها كأنها صوت.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":10}},{"id":"s015","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/15.72c74b1b.mp3","ms":3223,"text":"تظهر، وتبقى لحظة، ثم تمضي.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":13.7}},{"id":"s016","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/16.1b105701.mp3","ms":2196,"text":"لا حاجة إلى أن تتبعها.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":13}},{"id":"st06","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":62}}]},{"id":"offen","segmente":[{"id":"s017","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/17.84cbe4e7.mp3","ms":6561,"text":"اسمحِ الآن لكلّ ما يُسمَع أن يصل إليك. من غير أن تبحث عن شيء.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st07","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":65.5}},{"id":"s018","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/18.13576d7b.mp3","ms":4908,"text":"إذا لاحظتَ أن ذهنك شرد، فعُدْ ببساطة إلى الأصوات.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st08","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":19.8,"normal":59.3,"lang":65.5}},{"id":"s019","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/19.81811219.mp3","ms":5526,"text":"أصغِ إلى الأصوات وهي تأتي وحدَها، من غير أن تفعل أي شيء.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st09","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":65.5}}]},{"id":"rueckkehr","segmente":[{"id":"s020","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/20.75f24e96.mp3","ms":3573,"text":"تقترب الآن، بهدوء، من النهاية.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5.3}},{"id":"s021","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/21.3db76034.mp3","ms":3692,"text":"اشعُرْ بجسمك، وهو جالسٌ أو مستلقٍ.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.9}},{"id":"s022","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/22.ef7fa53d.mp3","ms":3150,"text":"خُذْ نَفَسًا عميقًا، ثم أخرِجْه.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5.3}},{"id":"s023","art":"sprache","datei":"kh/23.5957e782.mp3","ms":2051,"text":"افتحْ عينيك متى شئت.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3.2}},{"id":"glocke","art":"glocke","ton":"ende"}]}]}